# qrwatch launch env for the v5e-64 baseline-10k run.
# Sourced by qr_watch.sh -> launch_spot.sh on a hard QR reclaim (SUSPENDED/FAILED).
# Only TRC_PROFILE + DATA_SHARDS matter: the reclaimed slice boots idle-or-
# resume via ACTIVE_PROGRAM in GCS, so train knobs come from the program spec,
# not QR metadata. DATA_SHARDS=60 so the fresh slice stages enough FineWeb.
# 2026-07-23: switched europe-west4-b -> us-central1-a (ew4b capacity drought:
# stuck PROVISIONING 30 min, no VMs). Checkpoints -> gs://llm-architectures-usc1
# (in-region, us-central1) to keep saves off the cross-continent path.
TRC_PROFILE=v5e-64-uc1a
DATA_SHARDS=60
